B.c9=new A.bG(B.uT,["Claudia Painting LLC \u2014 Residential Interior & Exterior Painting","Services","Process","Gallery","Before & After","About","FAQ","Contact","Free estimate","Free estimates \xb7 Se habla espa\xf1ol","Your home deserves","a fresh start.","Residential painting done the way it should be \u2014 walls prepped, floors covered, price agreed before the first brushstroke.","Message us on WhatsApp","See our work","Price agreed up front","We clean up after ourselves","Fast replies on WhatsApp","Why us","Painting is the easy part.","Showing up, protecting your home and sticking to the price \u2014 that's what people remember.","Clean, careful work","We protect your furniture, floors and trim before we touch a wall. When we leave, your home is clean \u2014 and painted.","Inside and outside","A single bedroom or the whole exterior \u2014 one crew handles both.","Always reachable","Message us on WhatsApp any time. No waiting on hold.","No surprises","What we quote is what you pay \u2014 nothing added after the fact.","Services","Residential painting, inside and out.","Interior","Bedrooms, living rooms, kitchens, hallways. We prep the walls, protect your belongings and leave a smooth, even finish.","Walls, ceilings, trim and doors","Patching and surface prep","Furniture and floors covered every day","Exterior","The outside of your home is the first thing people see. Full repaints or touch-ups, houses of any size.","Siding, soffits, porches and columns","Windows, shutters, doors and railings","Plants, walkways and driveways masked off","Need both? Doing interior and exterior together usually saves you time \u2014 and a bit of money.","Process","Four steps, no guesswork.","You reach out","Send a WhatsApp message or fill out the form. Photos help, but aren't required.","Free estimate","We look at the space, talk colors and finishes, and give you a clear price.","We paint","We cover everything, prep the surfaces and work on the days we agreed.","You walk through","Room by room, together. Anything you don't like, we fix before we pack up.","Gallery","Real homes we painted.","Tap any photo to see it full size.","More projects added as we finish them.","All","Interiors","Exteriors","Prep & process","Before & after","Same room. New life.","Drag the handle to compare before and after.","Before","After","About","We take your home seriously.","Claudia Painting LLC started because we kept hearing the same complaints \u2014 painters who didn't show up, left a mess, or charged more than agreed. So we built the opposite: we show up, we do the work right, and we leave your home better than we found it.","We Paint. You Love. We Care.","FAQ","Good to know.","Is the estimate really free?","Yes. We come look at the space, talk about what you want, and give you a price \u2014 with no obligation to hire us.","Do I need to move my furniture?","No. We move what needs moving, cover everything, and put it back when we're finished.","Do you help pick the colors?","Happily. Tell us the feeling you're going for and we'll suggest colors and finishes that work for that room and that light.","Who buys the paint?","Either way works. We can supply everything, or paint with what you've already bought.","How long does a job take?","A single room is usually a day or two. A full interior or exterior depends on prep work and weather \u2014 we give you a realistic window with the estimate.","\xbfHablan espa\xf1ol?",u.B,"Contact","Let's talk about your project.","Tell us what you need and we'll get back to you as soon as we can.","WhatsApp / Phone","Both numbers take WhatsApp messages and calls.","WhatsApp","Call","Hours","Monday \u2013 Saturday \xb7 8:00 AM \u2013 6:00 PM","Languages","English & Espa\xf1ol","Request a free estimate","First name","Last name","Phone number","Email (optional)","What do you need?","Interior painting","Exterior painting","Interior & exterior","Not sure yet","Tell us about your project","What rooms or areas? Any colors in mind?","Send message","Sending\u2026","Message sent! We'll get back to you soon.","Couldn't send that. Try again, or message us on WhatsApp.","Please add your name and phone number.","Residential interior and exterior painting. Clean, careful work and honest prices.","All rights reserved","Explore","of","Close","Previous photo","Next photo","Menu"],t.li)
B.ca=new A.bG(B.uT,["Claudia Painting LLC \u2014 Pintura residencial interior y exterior","Servicios","Proceso","Galer\xeda","Antes y despu\xe9s","Nosotros","Preguntas","Contacto","Cotizaci\xf3n gratis","Cotizaci\xf3n gratis \xb7 Se habla espa\xf1ol","Su casa merece","un nuevo comienzo.","Pintura residencial hecha como debe ser: paredes preparadas, pisos cubiertos y el precio acordado antes de la primera brochada.","Escr\xedbanos por WhatsApp","Ver nuestros trabajos","Precio acordado desde el inicio","Dejamos todo limpio","Respuesta r\xe1pida por WhatsApp","Por qu\xe9 nosotros","Pintar es la parte f\xe1cil.","Llegar puntual, cuidar su casa y respetar el precio: eso es lo que la gente recuerda.","Trabajo limpio y cuidadoso","Protegemos sus muebles, pisos y molduras antes de tocar una pared. Cuando nos vamos, su casa queda limpia \u2014 y pintada.","Por dentro y por fuera","Una sola habitaci\xf3n o el exterior completo: un mismo equipo hace ambos.","Siempre disponibles","Escr\xedbanos por WhatsApp cuando quiera. Sin esperas en el tel\xe9fono.","Sin sorpresas","Lo que cotizamos es lo que paga \u2014 no agregamos cosas despu\xe9s.","Servicios","Pintura residencial, por dentro y por fuera.","Interiores","Rec\xe1maras, salas, cocinas, pasillos. Preparamos las paredes, protegemos sus cosas y dejamos un acabado parejo y liso.","Paredes, techos, molduras y puertas","Resane y preparaci\xf3n antes de pintar","Muebles y pisos cubiertos todos los d\xedas","Exteriores","El exterior de su casa es lo primero que la gente ve. Repintado completo o retoques, casas de cualquier tama\xf1o.","Fachada, aleros, porches y columnas","Ventanas, persianas, puertas y barandales","Plantas, banquetas y cocheras protegidas","\xbfNecesita ambos? Hacer interior y exterior juntos casi siempre le ahorra tiempo \u2014 y algo de dinero.","Proceso","Cuatro pasos, sin adivinanzas.","Usted nos escribe","M\xe1ndenos un WhatsApp o llene el formulario. Las fotos ayudan, pero no son obligatorias.","Cotizaci\xf3n gratis","Revisamos el espacio, hablamos de colores y acabados, y le damos un precio claro.","Pintamos","Cubrimos todo, preparamos las superficies y trabajamos en los d\xedas acordados.","Revisamos juntos","Cuarto por cuarto. Lo que no le guste, lo corregimos antes de recoger.","Galer\xeda","Casas reales que pintamos.","Toque cualquier foto para verla completa.","Vamos agregando proyectos conforme los terminamos.","Todos","Interiores","Exteriores","Proceso","Antes y despu\xe9s","El mismo cuarto. Otra vida.","Deslice la barra para comparar el antes y el despu\xe9s.","Antes","Despu\xe9s","Nosotros","Su casa nos importa de verdad.","Claudia Painting LLC naci\xf3 porque escuch\xe1bamos siempre las mismas quejas: pintores que no llegaban, que dejaban un desastre o que cobraban m\xe1s de lo acordado. As\xed que hicimos lo contrario: llegamos, hacemos el trabajo bien y dejamos su casa mejor de como la encontramos.","Pintamos. Usted ama. Nos importa.","Preguntas","Bueno saberlo.","\xbfLa cotizaci\xf3n realmente es gratis?","S\xed. Vamos a ver el espacio, hablamos de lo que quiere y le damos un precio \u2014 sin compromiso de contratarnos.","\xbfTengo que mover mis muebles?","No. Nosotros movemos lo necesario, cubrimos todo y lo regresamos a su lugar al terminar.","\xbfNos ayudan a escoger los colores?","Con gusto. D\xedganos qu\xe9 ambiente busca y le sugerimos colores y acabados que funcionen para ese cuarto y esa luz.","\xbfQui\xe9n compra la pintura?","Como usted prefiera. Podemos poner todo el material, o pintar con lo que usted ya compr\xf3.","\xbfCu\xe1nto tarda el trabajo?","Un cuarto normalmente toma uno o dos d\xedas. Un interior o exterior completo depende de la preparaci\xf3n y del clima \u2014 le damos un tiempo realista con la cotizaci\xf3n.","\xbfHablan espa\xf1ol?",u.B,"Contacto","Hablemos de su proyecto.","Cu\xe9ntenos qu\xe9 necesita y le respondemos lo antes posible.","WhatsApp / Tel\xe9fono","A los dos n\xfameros puede escribirles por WhatsApp o llamarles.","WhatsApp","Llamar","Horario","Lunes a s\xe1bado \xb7 8:00 AM \u2013 6:00 PM","Idiomas","Espa\xf1ol e ingl\xe9s","Solicite su cotizaci\xf3n gratis","Nombre","Apellido","Tel\xe9fono","Correo (opcional)","\xbfQu\xe9 necesita?","Pintura de interiores","Pintura de exteriores","Interior y exterior","Todav\xeda no estoy seguro","Cu\xe9ntenos sobre su proyecto","\xbfQu\xe9 cuartos o \xe1reas? \xbfAlg\xfan color en mente?","Enviar mensaje","Enviando\u2026","\xa1Mensaje enviado! Le respondemos pronto.","No se pudo enviar. Intente de nuevo o escr\xedbanos por WhatsApp.","Por favor complete su nombre y su tel\xe9fono.","Pintura residencial interior y exterior. Trabajo limpio y cuidadoso, y precios honestos.","Todos los derechos reservados","Explorar","de","Cerrar","Foto anterior","Foto siguiente","Men\xfa"],t.li)
